WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.080
For groups,

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.280
start in Configuration

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.090
and click My Groups.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.790
With Facebook connected,

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.750
choose Load From Facebook

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:08.850
to see the groups

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.150
available from your account.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.800
Select the relevant

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.900
local buy-and-sell

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.120
groups you want to use,

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.170
then choose Save Groups.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.300
Pick groups

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.320
that fit your area

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.810
and the vehicles you sell.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.200
Read their rules.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.620
Group administrators

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.440
still decide what gets approved.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.020
Your choices don't

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.060
guarantee that a post

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.260
will appear in that group.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.770
You can come back here

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:30.910
to review your choices.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.160
For an older Marketplace

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.980
listing, first check that

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.360
the vehicle is still available

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.220
and its information is current.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.130
Then click Post

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.510
to Market in the sidebar

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.910
and choose Posted to FB,

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.470
next to Available and Queue.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:48.070
Find the vehicle

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.850
and choose Repost.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:51.640
The blue Delete

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.240
and Repost control appears.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.240
This removes the original

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:56.540
listing published through

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:58.370
AutoLander and creates a fresh

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.540
listing for that vehicle.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.480
It isn't simply an edit

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:02.550
to the old description,

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.860
and it doesn't guarantee

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.000
a particular place

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.060
in a shopper's feed.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.450
For practice, locate your group

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.810
settings and the Posted

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:10.830
to FB tab.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.540
Explain what Delete

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.380
and Repost does, without

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.320
deleting or reposting a vehicle

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.400
just for the lesson.
